Thanks Javier! I pushed two changes on top of your commit.

The cache is now skipped in debug mode. Editing `#[ExposeInTemplate]` on a private property does not rebuild the container, so the cached metadata would go stale.

`warmup()` now rebuilds every entry. Running `cache:warmup` over an existing cache refreshes the metadata instead of saving the old one again.
